  "question": {
    "text": "In the circuit shown switch <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> is connected to position <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> for a long time and then joined to the position <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>. The total heat produced in resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is :<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" height=\"164\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032945_Question.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"159\" />",
